# analytics/public/leanmill is ~21GB of solver/training data the workbench does
# not read (job state under workbench/ is created at runtime — see the mkdir in
# forensic-workbench/Dockerfile). Excluded outright: a negated re-include here
# defeats Docker's directory-skip and leaks the whole tree into the context.
analytics/public/leanmill
analytics/public/gnn
analytics/public/index
analytics/private
ztare_proofs/.lake

